  m_Name: mananangal
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HalimawEntry
  monsterName: Mananangal
  lore: A feared creature that appears as a beautiful woman by day but transforms
    at night by separating her upper body from her lower half. With enormous bat-like
    wings, she silently flies across villages in search of prey. The Manananggal
    feeds on the blood and organs of sleeping victims, especially pregnant women.
    Before dawn, it must reunite with its lower body or risk perishing in the sunlight
  weakness: 'Salt

    Holy Water'
